[BEGIN]
  ObjTp=Hd
  Cmn1=IV-CAM PTZ v1.0\\\\Press F1 for IV-CAM PTZ v1.0.html. Leave that||1
  Cmn2=file next to this module.\\\\A live IV-CAM-P12 accepted address-
  Cmn3=1 home on TCP port 5500.\\\\v1.0  2026-11-03\\- Raw VISCA pan, tilt,||1
  Cmn4=zoom, and presets\\- Simpl# socket on TCP port 5500\\- IP_Address||1
  Cmn5=and IP_Address_Override\\- Enable high connects. Enable low disconnects.
  Cmn6=\\\\v1.0  2026-11-07\\- Wake is power on, 81 01 04 00 02 FF. Privacy||1
  Cmn7=toggles standby and wake.\\- Connect sends a power inquiry. Awake_FB||1
  Cmn8=or Privacy_FB follows the reply.\\- A PTZ press in standby sends||1
  Cmn9=wake. The move runs only if that button is still held when the camera||1
  Cmn10=is awake and one second has passed.
[END]
